3. Modify the source

	include:config.h
		a. define 'MAC'
		b. comment out definitoin of 'UNIX'
		c. leave MAC_MPW32 defined
	
	src:decl.c
		a. split decl.c into two files 'decl_a.c' & 'decl_b.c' moving the
declaration of 'level' to 'decl_b.c'  leave everything else in 'decl_a.c'
	
	sys:mac:hack.h
		a. this should be deleted.  It is needed for the MPW compile and will
interfere with the Think C compile.

	sys:mac:macfile.c
		a. FlushVol( NULL, theDirs . dataRefNum ) --> FlushVol((StringPtr)
NULL, theDirs.dataRefNum)
	
	sys:mac:macerrs.c
		a. exclude the inclusion of <String.h> and <Strings.h>
	
	sys:mac:maccurs.c
		a. cast NULL to (void *)
		b. cast sh to (Handle)
	
	sys:mac:macmain.c
		a. exclude the inclustion of <String.h> and <Strings.h>
		b. exclude the inclustion of <SysEqu.h>
	
	sys:mac:macmenu.c
		a. cast NULL to (void *)
		b. cast uitmChar to (char *)
	
	sys:mac:macsnd.c
		a. cast NULL to (SndChannelPtr)
		b. cast SND_BUFFER to (long)
	
	sys:mac:mactopl.c
		a. modify the argument to try_key_queue(&buf) to (buf) -- in general
remove &buf where needed
		b. cast pointers to (char *) where needed
		c. cast NULL to (void *) where needed
		d. cast resp to (char *) when calling queued_resp
	
	sys:mac:mgetline.c
		a. make cast to (char *) where needed
	
	sys:mac:mttymain.c
		a. make cast to (char *) where needed
	
	sys:mac:macconf.h
		a. comment out definition of NHW_BASE
	
	sys:mac:dprintf.c
		a. exclude the inclusion of <strings.h>
	
	sys:share:lev_yacc.c
		a. remove the extern declaration of malloc and realloc.
		b. modify check for MAC_THINK5 to include check for THINK_C
		c. add the definition of SPEC_LEV at top of file
	
	sys:share:dgn_yacc.c
		a. remove the extern declaration of malloc and realloc
		b. modify the check for MAC_THINK5 to include check for THINK_C
		c. cast buffer to (unsigned char *) in calls to DebugStr

	util:lev_main.c
		a. modify the check for MAC_THINK5 to include check for THINK_C
		b. add the definition of SPEC_LEV at top of file
	
	util:dgn_main.c
		a. change WRMODE to "w+b"

	util:makedefs.c
		a. remove the inclusion of <string.h> and <ctype.h>

	src:questpgr.c, src:dungeon.c, src:sp_lev.c
		a. change RDMODE to "rb"
	
	sys:mac:NetHack.r
		a. modify inclusion path to exclude the MPW shell variable $XXX


4. Move files

	a. sys:mac:cmdhelp to top most directory
	
5. Copy files

	a. copy of sys:mac:NHDeflts to NetHack Defaults (top most directory)

6. Compile and run MakeDefs

	a. -v to build 'options'.  Move 'options' to obj
	b. -o to create 'onames.h'
	c. -p to create 'pm.h'
	d. -z to create 'vis_tab.h'
	e. -e to create 'dundeon.pdf'.  Move 'dungeon.pdf' to obj.
	f. -m to create 'monstr.c'
	g. -d to create 'data'.  Move 'data' to top most directory.
	h. -r to create 'rumors'.  Move 'rumors' to top most directory.
	i. -h to create 'oracles'.  Move 'oracles' to top most directory.
	j. -q to create 'quest.dat'. Move 'quest.data' to top most directory.

		
7. Compile and run LevComp.

8. Compile and run DgnComp.

9. Compile and run NetHack.

